Multi-omics data encompasses:
1. Drosophila Ras-driven tumor model bulk RNA-seq data at different time points
2. Drosophila Ras-driven tumor model bulk ATAC-seq data at different time points
3. TCGA and GTEx gene expression data for pan-cancer evaluation
4. CBioProtal gene mutation data for pan-cancer evaluation
5. TCGA patient clinical data
6. Human cancer scRNA-seq data
